            "review_title": "Review at Luca Pub",
            "review_text": "Oliver C\nWagga Wagga, New South Wales, Australia28 contributions\n0\nGood western option\nMar 2018 • Solo\nLuca bar and cafe is similar to La casa (across the road and turns out they use the same kitchen during the day). I had a burger there and it was good. Beer on tap is a bonus. Just a heads up that although sitting out the front in the street seems cool, you become prone to hawkers trying to sell stuff. A seat inside might be a better option.\n\nA little pricey, but worth it for the better seating and service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 29, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
