            "review_text": "Leanne E\n62 contributions\n0\nGreat pub with good prices.\nJul 2017 • Couples\nWe came here everyday on our travels because they have air conditioning inside. The furnishings are comfortable. happy hour is the best on the strip with buy one get one free for 80,000 dong for 2 cocktails. The presentation of the drinks is great. The toilet is decent and the DJ is pretty good too with a selection of hip hop and R & B. We had a nice lunch here that was delicious and cheap. Definately worth a visit.\nRead more\nWritten July 20, 2017",
