            "review_title": "Review at Luca Pub",
            "review_text": "toshboro\nmiddlesbrough72 contributions\n0\nGood for happy hour drinking\nJul 2017 • Solo\nif you are staying on Bui Vien all night It's not a bad place to start. The happy hour starts from 6-00pm where you buy 2 get 1 free so it works out 80,000dong for 3 bottles which on Bui Vien is very good. Be careful to look at the notice board which drinks a offered for the 2-1 offer. Some nights it may be Tiger,Heinekin and Saigon, other nights it may only be heinekin so it pays to just check. One critcism is they have only 1 toilet upstairs which is for everyone. So it's one person in one person out. As you can imagine if it's fairly busy and the drinks are flowing you can get quite a queue waiting to use the toilet.As i said at the beginning it's ok to start of there because it's at the very top of Bui Vien.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 18, 2017",
